DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22016::$$$message_0171_0000_0000$$$::   Now.[lr]::
22017::$$$message_0171_0000_0001$$$::I'm not even sure how it came to this, [se volume=40 storage=se545.wav]but in order to defeat an enemy we haven't even seen yet, it seems like we will need more help.[lr]::
22018::$$$message_0171_0000_0002$$$::Archer is out of the question.[lr]::
22019::$$$message_0171_0000_0003$$$::Caster is a fortress on lockdown. Assassin is a guardian deity. Rider is only amiable if it involves Sakura's safety.[lr]::
22020::$$$message_0171_0000_0004$$$::Illya is spectating out of entertainment, so the only one I can rely on is...::
22021::$$$message_0171_0001_0000$$$::"Hey, Lancer."[lr]::
22022::$$$message_0171_0001_0001$$$::I wave and greet him.[lr]::
22023::$$$message_0171_0001_0002$$$::It probably won't work if I beat around the bush, so I get straight to the point.::
22024::$$$message_0171_0002_0000$$$::I explain the situation to the best of my ability.[lr]::
22025::$$$message_0171_0002_0001$$$::The abnormality in the past four days.[lr]::
22026::$$$message_0171_0002_0002$$$::Though I haven't truly met her, the vague looks and fighting style of the eighth Master that I know.[lr]::
22027::$$$message_0171_0002_0003$$$::The fact that the female mage is most likely involved with the abnormality of the town.[lr]::
22028::$$$message_0171_0002_0004$$$::And how Saber and I aren't compatible with her, so we need the help of another Servant.::
22029::$$$message_0171_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
22030::$$$message_0171_0003_0001$$$::Lancer doesn't even look my way the entire time.[lr]::
22031::$$$message_0171_0003_0002$$$::His eyes that gaze at the sky listlessly gradually become displeased.::
22032::$$$message_0171_0004_0000$$$::"Let me make sure of something. Did that girl dress in a suit and have short red hair?"[lr]::
22033::$$$message_0171_0004_0001$$$::"Hm? Yeah, and leather gloves that were great for punching me."[lr]::
22034::$$$message_0171_0004_0002$$$::"Did she have earrings?"[lr]::
22035::$$$message_0171_0004_0003$$$::"Huh? ...I don't think so."[lr]::
22036::$$$message_0171_0004_0004$$$::"Last question. Was there anything strange about her body?"[lr]::
22037::$$$message_0171_0004_0005$$$::"What? ...Well, nothing that I could see. I don't know if her clothes concealed anything though."::
22038::$$$message_0171_0005_0000$$$::That was all of his questions.[lr]::
22039::$$$message_0171_0005_0001$$$::After that...[lr]::
22040::$$$message_0171_0005_0002$$$::"...Then it'd be pointless.[lr]::
22041::$$$message_0171_0005_0003$$$::No thanks. Ain't a reason to after kicking the bucket myself."[lr]::
22042::$$$message_0171_0005_0004$$$::Lancer quietly says.::
22043::$$$message_0171_0006_0000$$$::"Lancer. I don't know who she is yet.[lr]::
22044::$$$message_0171_0006_0001$$$::But it's certain that she's an enemy.[lr]::
22045::$$$message_0171_0006_0002$$$::Next time when Saber and I patrol at night, we could use your help[line len=3]"::
22046::$$$message_0171_0007_0000$$$::"Sorry, ask someone else. I'll pass."[lr]::
22047::$$$message_0171_0007_0001$$$::His wording is casual, but that is a hard no.[lr]::
22048::$$$message_0171_0007_0002$$$::I often forget this guy's real scary sometimes.[lr]::
22049::$$$message_0171_0007_0003$$$::So much so that he smiles even while he's ruthlessly cutting things down with that polearm of his.::
22050::$$$message_0171_0008_0000$$$::"...Can I ask why not?"[lr]::
22051::$$$message_0171_0008_0001$$$::"I just ain't interested. It's not like I'm trying to make it hard on you.[lr]::
22052::$$$message_0171_0008_0002$$$::I do owe you one, and normally I'd take you up on this sorta thing. But this is a little different.[lr]::
22053::$$$message_0171_0008_0003$$$::Even if it was the king's order, I'd have to shoot him down."::
22054::$$$message_0171_0009_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
22055::$$$message_0171_0009_0001$$$::There's no room for negotiation if he says that.[lr]::
22056::$$$message_0171_0009_0002$$$::Despite his history with following his king's orders, he'd still say no.[lr]::
22057::$$$message_0171_0009_0003$$$::When it comes to her, I must not be able to negotiate anything with Lancer.::
922032::$$$message_9171_0004_0000$$$::"Let me make sure of something. Did that girl dress in a suit and have short red hair?"[r]::

